# Hello! Welcome to our 1p analysis pipeline, which is still under construction. We aim to create a comprehensive analysis pipeline for behavioral and neural data collected with Miniscopes. 

# Installation Instructions

1. Install Conda
2. Clone pursuit repository from here: https://github.com/bigbrainmay/1p_pipeline.git 
3. Create Conda environment:
```bash

conda create --name <my-env> python=3.13
conda activate <my-env>

```
4. Activate Conda environment:
```bash

conda activate myenv

```
5. Navigate to the directory where the GitHub repo is cloned
```bash

cd path/to/repo

```

6. Install Build Tools for Visual Studio from here: https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/ and install "Desktop Development with C++"

7. Install dependencies from pyproject.toml:
```bash

pip install -e . 

```
